Preamble
This document, titled "Global Requirements Expression – AI and Automation Solution for the Group", aims to define the functional and security requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) and automation solution designed to optimize operations within the group. It is a strategic initiative intended to enhance operational efficiency, security, and productivity across all teams and technical scopes.
The document is structured into two main parts: the first part details the global and team-specific functional requirements, while the second part focuses on the rigorous security requirements for AI solutions. Each section is designed to provide a clear and actionable vision of the required features, integrating AI-assisted improvements to accelerate development and implementation.
This document will serve as a reference for development teams, architects, and security managers to ensure that the final solution meets the highest standards of performance, security, and compliance.
