Introduction
This document, titled "Global Requirements Expression – AI and Automation Solution for the Group", is intended to outline the functional and security requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) and automation solution aimed at optimizing operations across the group. This strategic initiative seeks to enhance operational efficiency, security, and productivity for all teams and technical areas.
It is divided into two key sections: 
•	The first section covers the overarching and team-specific functional requirements. 
