Intelligent & Interactive Chatbots
•	Smart Service Catalog:
An automated interactive assistant helping internal and external users quickly and accurately identify the service corresponding to their need, with automatic creation of associated requests. 
o	Enhanced Feature: AI-Enhanced Natural Language Search 
	Idea: Interpret complex user queries and match them to the most appropriate services using semantic understanding powered by NLP. 
	Benefits: Improves user experience by reducing search time and increasing accuracy of service discovery. 
	Implementation Feasibility: Feasible with NLP and semantic search technologies (e.g., Elasticsearch with AI plugins), leveraging your existing catalog data.
•	Chatbot for User Level 1 Support:
Automated assistance that answers frequent questions (FAQ), automatically identifies user issues, and creates and assigns tickets directly to the appropriate teams based on AI’s analysis of the problem. 
o	Enhanced Feature: Sentiment Analysis for Escalation 
	Idea: Detect user frustration or urgency in real-time (e.g., via tone or repeated queries), automatically escalating complex issues to human agents. 
	Benefits: Enhances customer satisfaction by ensuring timely human intervention for critical issues. 
	Implementation Feasibility: High—uses off-the-shelf sentiment analysis models integrated with your chatbot escalation workflows.
•	Advanced Technical Chatbot (Admin Companion):
Interactive intelligent support providing real-time, in-depth technical information (internal procedures, precise equipment configuration, diagnostics, recommended actions), based on incident history, internal and vendor knowledge bases. 
o	Enhanced Feature: Command Execution Capability 
	Idea: Enable the chatbot to execute simple commands or scripts (e.g., restarting a service, checking status) with strict security controls and sandboxing. 
	Benefits: Reduces resolution times for common technical issues, empowering users with immediate solutions. 
	Implementation Feasibility: Feasible with secure command execution frameworks and sandboxed environments, integrating with your IT systems.
•	Multichannel Intelligent Chatbots (Teams, Web, Business Applications):
Capability to interact naturally with users through various communication channels, ensuring fast and contextualized responses to routine or complex requests, with seamless integration into internal tools (ticketing, SIEM, GLPI, etc.). 
o	Enhanced Feature: Context Preservation Across Channels 
	Idea: Maintain conversation history across channels, allowing seamless transitions (e.g., from web to mobile) without data loss. 
	Benefits: Provides a unified, uninterrupted user experience, increasing engagement and satisfaction. 
	Implementation Feasibility: High—requires a centralized conversation management system with cloud-based storage, aligning with your infrastructure.
•	Enhanced Feature: Contextual Escalation Prediction 
o	Idea: Add an AI feature to predict when human escalation is needed based on user frustration (e.g., repeated queries, negative sentiment) or complexity, pre-emptively alerting support teams. 
o	Benefits: Reduces user frustration, streamlines workflows, and enhances support efficiency. 
o	Implementation Feasibility: Feasible with your NLP capabilities and internal data streams (e.g., chat logs). Train sentiment analysis models (e.g., BERT-based) using in-house resources, integrating with existing chatbot frameworks via APIs.
