________________________________________
General Objectives
•	Confidentiality:
Strict protection of sensitive data processed by AI solutions, preventing any unintentional disclosure or unauthorized access by third parties. 
•	Integrity:
Guarantee that data and the results generated by AI remain reliable, accurate, and unaltered during storage, transmission, or processing. 
•	Availability:
Ensure continuous, stable availability of critical AI services, even in case of technical incidents or cyberattacks. 
•	Traceability and Auditability:
Complete, systematic, and secure logging of all exchanges and transactions carried out via AI services to enable audits, investigations, or quick inquiries in the event of an incident. 
•	Enhanced Feature: AI-Driven Security Posture Assessor 
o	Idea: Continuously evaluate and suggest improvements to the security posture based on current threats and vulnerabilities. 
o	Benefits: Maintains a proactive, robust security stance, adapting to evolving risks. 
o	Implementation Feasibility: High—uses threat intelligence and security analytics, leveraging your security infrastructure.
________________________________________
Security of Incoming Prompts (Input)
•	Robust Authentication and Granular ACLs:
Implementation of strong authentication (MFA, OAuth, SSO) to precisely control access to AI services. Application of granular access controls by user, service, or business domain, strictly limiting access to AI functionalities according to user profiles and responsibilities. 
•	Stringent Prompt Validation and Filtering:
Deployment of advanced input validation mechanisms to ensure the coherence of data submitted to AI (format, length, data type). Detection and proactive prevention of malicious or non-compliant prompt injection attempts. 
•	Automated Sanitization and Normalization of Inputs:
Automatic sanitization of incoming data to eliminate any dangerous content, special characters, or potentially malicious structures that could affect AI models. 
•	Comprehensive Logging and Proactive Monitoring:
Complete, secure, systematic recording of incoming prompts with timestamps, source, data type, enabling exhaustive analysis in case of an incident or audit requirement. Permanent monitoring of suspicious behaviors with immediate alerts in case of unusual or malicious usage patterns. 
•	Enhanced Feature: AI-Driven Input Validator 
o	Idea: Learn from past attacks to enhance detection and prevention of malicious inputs using an adaptive AI model. 
o	Benefits: Strengthens defenses against evolving threats, improving input security. 
o	Implementation Feasibility: Feasible with machine learning and attack data, integrated with your security systems.
________________________________________
Security of Outgoing Prompts (Output)
•	Automatic Filtering of Generated Content:
Implementation of automated moderation mechanisms (whitelist, blacklist, automatic detection of sensitive or inappropriate content) to prevent data leakage. Automatic anonymization of sensitive data contained in AI-generated responses, according to predefined criteria. 
•	Integrity Verification (Digital Signatures and Encryption):
Systematic guarantee of the integrity of produced responses through the use of robust encryption techniques and digital signatures, ensuring no data alteration during transit. 
•	Contextual Personalization of Responses:
Dynamic adaptation of AI-provided answers based on the specific user context (profile, access rights, history), avoiding disclosure of unauthorized or out-of-context information. 
•	Automatic Alerting in Case of Data Leakage Risk:
Proactive, immediate detection of potentially sensitive responses, triggering automatic alerts to security teams before final dissemination. 
•	Enhanced Feature: Automated Redaction Feature 
o	Idea: Remove sensitive data from outputs based on recipient clearance levels using AI-driven classification. 
o	Benefits: Enhances data protection and compliance by ensuring only authorized information is shared. 
o	Implementation Feasibility: High—uses data classification and access controls, integrated with your security framework.
•	Enhanced Feature: Automated Security Policy Enforcement 
o	Idea: Add an AI layer to enforce policies dynamically (e.g., blocking non-compliant API calls) based on real-time context. 
